<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian rules-AFL play-off results.</title>
<headline>Australian rules-AFL play-off results.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian Rules play-off matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> West Coast   8.19  (67)  Essendon  22.12 (144)</p>
<p> Brisbane    26.14 (170)  Carlton   10.13  (73)</p>
<p>Semifinals: North Melbourne v Brisbane, Sydney v Essendon, Saturday, September 21.</p>
